{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the dark depths of the underground realms, power and status depend on passion and promiscuity. It is a world of wonders where only women dwell and the priestesses of the <strong>Queen of Phalli </strong>rule unmatched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide Young Elifael El'Naar as she prepares for her Baptism, a perilous ceremony to prove her loyalty to her House and devotion to the Goddess. Should she succeed, she will have taken her first step to becoming a priestess herself. Should she fail, she may lose her status and even her mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Queen of Phalli</strong> is a richly illustrated, choice-driven adventure that invites you to a world full of dangers and delights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep Narrative Immersion</strong>: Uncover a story filled with intrigue, emotional depth, and difficult decisions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beautiful Hand-Drawn Artwork</strong>: Experience stunning visuals that bring the characters and their world to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Branching Choices</strong>: Guide Elifael as she must fight for her sisters' affection and respect. There are many paths to explore, many mutually exclusive, so choose carefully.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Complex, Mature Themes</strong>: Explore a society obsessed with power, sexuality, and tradition, all woven into an engaging and thought-provoking narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Endings</strong>: Witness the consequences of her actions in several compelling outcomes, from triumph to tragedy.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3277040?t=1742463628","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3277040?t=1742463628","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.st